---
layout: layouts/page.njk
permalink: /articles/index.html
contentType: archive
title: 文章
eyebrow: Long-form archive
description: 完整记录真实项目、工作方法与人机协作过程。
---
<div class="archive-list">
  {% for article in collections.publishedArticles %}
  <a class="archive-entry" href="{{ article.url }}">
    <span class="archive-entry__number">{{ loop.index }}</span>
    <span><strong>{{ article.data.title }}</strong><span>{{ article.data.description }}</span></span>
    <time datetime="{{ article.data.publishedAt | isoDate }}">{{ article.data.publishedAt | displayDate(article.data.lang) }}</time>
  </a>
  {% else %}<p>第一篇长文正在整理中。</p>{% endfor %}
</div>
